---
// Meet Manny — owner section, in the original design's style.
import { site } from '../data/site';
interface Props { headingLevel?: 'h1' | 'h2' }
const { headingLevel: H = 'h2' } = Astro.props;
---
  <section class="section manny" id="about" aria-labelledby="mannyH">
    <div class="wrap manny-grid">
      <div class="manny-visual">
        <div class="manny-card">
          <img class="manny-photo" src={site.owner.photo} width="800" height="1000" alt="Illustrative temporary portrait for Manny’s section; not a photograph of Manny" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 400 120" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M0 60c70-26 130-26 200 0s130 26 200 0v60H0z" fill="#167DC4" opacity=".55"/><path d="M0 84c70-22 130-22 200 0s130 22 200 0v36H0z" fill="#0B2335"/></svg>
          <div class="manny-name"><b>Manny</b><span>Owner &amp; Founder</span></div>
        </div>
        <p class="portrait-caption">Temporary illustrative portrait — Manny&rsquo;s photo coming soon.</p>
        <div class="manny-badge"><span class="snap-tag">Since Harvey</span><b>2017</b><span>Family-owned &amp; Houston-operated</span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="manny-copy">
        <span class="eyebrow">Meet the owner</span>
        <H id="mannyH">Started after Harvey hit home.</H>
        <p class="lede">In 2017, Hurricane Harvey put Manny&rsquo;s family and friends through what thousands of Houston households lived through: water where it never should have been, and no good answer for keeping it out next time.</p>
        <p>The flood-prevention options on the market were ineffective, half-measures or priced out of reach. So Manny and the team designed and built their own drainage systems. That work became Flood Mitigators, and it is still family-owned and Houston-operated today.</p>
        <ul class="checks">
          <li><span class="check"><svg><use href="#i-check"/></svg></span><div><b>Family-owned, Houston-operated</b><span>Started here after Harvey, and still run here.</span></div></li>
          <li><span class="check"><svg><use href="#i-check"/></svg></span><div><b>3-year parts &amp; labor limited warranty</b><span>Backing the drainage systems we install.</span></div></li>
          <li><span class="check"><svg><use href="#i-check"/></svg></span><div><b>24/7 emergency response</b><span>When water is threatening your home, call any time.</span></div></li>
        </ul>
        <div class="manny-actions">
          <a class="btn btn-primary" href={site.phone.href}><svg><use href="#i-phone"/></svg>Call Manny&rsquo;s team</a>
          <button class="btn btn-ghost" data-book="">Book an assessment <svg><use href="#i-arrow"/></svg></button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
